# Mosquitto ACL — topic-level authorization
# 一個帳號一個角色，最小權限：publisher 只能 publish、subscriber 只能 subscribe。
# 帳號被竊不會擴大成「能讀也能寫」。

# Simulator：只能往 telemetry topic publish
user simulator
topic write iot/sites/+/devices/+/telemetry

# Ingestor：只能訂閱 telemetry topic，不能假冒設備發訊息
user ingestor
topic read iot/sites/+/devices/+/telemetry

# Healthcheck：只走獨立 topic，避免污染真實 telemetry
user healthcheck
topic readwrite healthcheck
